---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
  <!-- NAV -->
  <header class="nav">
    <div class="container nav-inner">
      <a href="#" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.02em">
        <span style="width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#7C5CFF,#2EF2A0);display:grid;place-items:center;color:#070A14;font-weight:800">R</span>
        Runmote
        <span style="font-weight:600;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;border:1px solid var(--border);padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--surface)">ACP</span>
      </a>
      <nav class="nav-links">
        <a href="#how">How it works</a>
        <a href="#features">Features</a>
        <a href="#stats">Stats</a>
        <a href="#faq">FAQ</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/Raza-learner/Runmote" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GitHub</a>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" style="padding:10px 14px" href="#install">Get started →</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="section" style="padding-top:42px">
    <div class="container" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 0.9fr;gap:32px;align-items:center">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow reveal">No SSH • No VPN • Just QR or 8-digit code</div>
        <h1 class="reveal" data-delay="80" style="margin-top:14px">
          Run any <span style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#7C5CFF,#2EF2A0);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent">ACP agent</span><br/>from your phone.
        </h1>
        <p class="lead reveal" data-delay="160" style="margin-top:14px">
          Start <b style="color:var(--text)">opencode</b> from the bus. Resume <b style="color:var(--text)">claude code</b> from bed. Fix a bug with <b style="color:var(--text)">codex</b> while waiting for coffee.
        </p>

        <div class="reveal" data-delay="220" style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:18px">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#install">curl | bash install →</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=dev.runmote.app" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Get on Google Play</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://github.com/Raza-learner/Runmote" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">★ Star on GitHub</a>
        </div>

        <div class="reveal" data-delay="280" style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:16px">
          <span class="code-pill" id="install"><span style="opacity:.7">$</span> curl -fsSL https://runmote.dev/install.sh | bash <button data-copy="curl -fsSL https://runmote.dev/install.sh | bash" style="margin-left:6px;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--text);padding:6px 8px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;font-size:12px">Copy</button></span>
          <span class="code-pill" style="font-size:12px">Windows: <code style="color:#8BE9A8">irm https://runmote.dev/install.ps1 | iex</code></span>
        </div>

        <p class="reveal" data-delay="340" style="color:var(--faint);font-size:12px;margin-top:10px">Works with any ACP agent — opencode, Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Copilot. No port forwarding.</p>

        <div class="reveal" data-delay="380" style="display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:center;margin-top:14px;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px">
          <span>★ Live GitHub stats below</span>
          <span>•</span>
          <span>Free & open source (MIT)</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="phone-wrap reveal" data-delay="200" style="display:grid;place-items:center">
        <div class="phone">
          <div class="phone-screen">
            <div class="phone-notch"></div>
            <div style="padding:14px 14px 10px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between">
              <b style="font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)">Runmote</b>
              <span style="width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--accent-2);box-shadow:0 0 12px rgba(46,242,160,0.8)"></span>
            </div>
            <div style="margin:8px 14px;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(124,92,255,0.12);border:1px solid rgba(124,92,255,0.2)">
              <div style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#B9A6FF;font-weight:700">Pairing code</div>
              <div style="font-family:JetBrains Mono,monospace;font-size:28px;letter-spacing:0.18em;font-weight:800">84 • 92 • 17 • 05</div>
              <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">QR or 8-digit — expires on restart</div>
            </div>
            <div style="margin:10px 14px;display:grid;gap:8px">
              <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;padding:10px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border)"><span style="width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:8px;background:#0E1326;display:grid;place-items:center;border:1px solid var(--border)">◐</span><div><div style="font-weight:700;font-size:13px">opencode</div><div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">acp • auto-detected</div></div><span style="margin-left:auto;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--accent-2)"></span></div>
              <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;padding:10px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border)"><span style="width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:8px;background:#0E1326;display:grid;place-items:center;border:1px solid var(--border)">✦</span><div><div style="font-weight:700;font-size:13px">claude</div><div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">claude-agent-acp</div></div><span style="margin-left:auto;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--accent-2)"></span></div>
              <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;padding:10px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border)"><span style="width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:8px;background:#0E1326;display:grid;place-items:center;border:1px solid var(--border)">⬡</span><div><div style="font-weight:700;font-size:13px">codex</div><div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">codex-acp</div></div><span style="margin-left:auto;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--accent)"></span></div>
            </div>
            <div style="margin-top:auto;padding:12px 14px;display:flex;gap:8px">
              <span style="flex:1;padding:10px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#7C5CFF,#5A36FF);color:white;text-align:center;font-weight:800;font-size:13px">Connect</span>
              <span style="padding:10px 14px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);font-weight:700;font-size:13px">Scan QR</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="glow"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- MARQUEE -->
  <div class="marquee" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="marquee-track">
      <span>opencode</span><span>claude code</span><span>codex</span><span>cursor</span><span>copilot</span><span>gemini cli</span><span>ACP</span><span>WebSocket WSS</span><span>QR • 8-digit</span>
      <span>opencode</span><span>claude code</span><span>codex</span><span>cursor</span><span>copilot</span><span>gemini cli</span><span>ACP</span><span>WebSocket WSS</span><span>QR • 8-digit</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- WHY -->
  <section id="why" class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="eyebrow reveal">Why Runmote over SSH?</div>
      <h2 class="reveal" data-delay="80" style="margin-top:10px">You <em style="font-style:italic;color:var(--accent-2);font-weight:800">could</em> SSH tunnel at 11pm.</h2>
      <p class="lead reveal" data-delay="120" style="margin-top:8px">Or one curl command and you are done. No iptables. No port forwarding. Works on 4G, office WiFi, hotel WiFi.</p>

      <div class="grid reveal" data-delay="160" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);margin-top:22px">
        <div class="card"><h3>Setup</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0 0">SSH: 30 min of firewall hell<br/><b style="color:var(--accent-2)">Runmote: one curl | bash</b></p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>Network</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0 0">SSH: port-forward every network<br/><b style="color:var(--accent-2)">Runmote: any network, WSS encrypted</b></p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>Sessions</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0 0">SSH: hope tmux survived<br/><b style="color:var(--accent-2)">Runmote: built-in resume, last message</b></p></div>
      </div>

      <div class="card reveal" data-delay="200" style="margin-top:16px;overflow:auto">
        <div style="min-width:560px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1fr 1fr;gap:0;font-size:13px">
          <div style="padding:12px 14px;color:var(--faint);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase">Feature</div><div style="padding:12px 14px;color:var(--faint);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase">SSH</div><div style="padding:12px 14px;color:var(--faint);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase">Runmote</div>
          <div style="padding:12px 14px;border-top:1px solid var(--border)">Setup time</div><div style="padding:12px 14px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--muted)">30 min</div><div style="padding:12px 14px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--accent-2);font-weight:700">One command</div>
          <div style="padding:12px 14px;border-top:1px solid var(--border)">Mobile app</div><div style="padding:12px 14px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--muted)">Termius + tmux + prayer</div><div style="padding:12px 14px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--accent-2);font-weight:700">Native Flutter</div>
          <div style="padding:12px 14px;border-top:1px solid var(--border)">Self-host relay</div><div style="padding:12px 14px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--muted)">—</div><div style="padding:12px 14px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--accent-2);font-weight:700">Docker one-liner</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- HOW IT WORKS -->
  <section id="how" class="section" style="padding-top:0">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="eyebrow reveal">How it works</div>
      <h2 class="reveal" data-delay="80" style="margin-top:10px">Three steps. Two minutes.</h2>
      <div class="grid reveal" data-delay="140" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);margin-top:18px">
        <div class="card"><div style="width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:999px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:rgba(124,92,255,0.15);border:1px solid rgba(124,92,255,0.25);font-weight:800">1</div><h3 style="margin-top:12px">Install daemon on your PC</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;margin:6px 0 10px">Linux / Mac / Windows — auto-detects agents.</p><div class="code-pill" style="font-size:12px">curl -fsSL https://runmote.dev/install.sh | bash</div></div>
        <div class="card"><div style="width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:999px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:rgba(46,242,160,0.12);border:1px solid rgba(46,242,160,0.25);font-weight:800">2</div><h3 style="margin-top:12px">Open app, scan QR or type 8-digit</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;margin:6px 0 0">No manual IP, no VPN. Code rotates on restart, visible in terminal via <span class="kbd">runmote code</span>.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><div style="width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:999px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:rgba(255,92,154,0.12);border:1px solid rgba(255,92,154,0.25);font-weight:800">3</div><h3 style="margin-top:12px">Code from anywhere</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;margin:6px 0 0">Streaming chat, tool calls, diffs, approvals — same ACP session resumes if app dies.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FEATURES -->
  <section id="features" class="section" style="padding-top:0">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="grid" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)">
        <div class="card reveal"><h3>⚡ One command install</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:14px">Auto-detects opencode/claude/codex/cursor. No config files.</p></div>
        <div class="card reveal" data-delay="60"><h3>🔗 QR • 8-digit pairing</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:14px">Camera scan or manual entry. No SSH keys to copy.</p></div>
        <div class="card reveal" data-delay="120"><h3>♻️ Persistent sessions</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:14px">Switch apps, phone dies — resume from last message.</p></div>
        <div class="card reveal"><h3>🌊 Streaming</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:14px">Watch the agent think, run tools, apply diffs live.</p></div>
        <div class="card reveal" data-delay="60"><h3>🌍 Any network</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:14px">Home, office, 4G, coffee shop. All WSS/TLS.</p></div>
        <div class="card reveal" data-delay="120"><h3>🖥️ Cross-platform</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:14px">Daemon on Linux, macOS, Windows. Relay self-hostable.</p></div>
      </div>

      <div class="card reveal" data-delay="160" style="margin-top:16px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;align-items:center">
        <span style="font-weight:700;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--faint)">Supported agents</span>
        <span style="margin-left:8px;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);font-size:12px;font-weight:700">opencode</span>
        <span style="padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);font-size:12px;font-weight:700">cursor-agent</span>
        <span style="padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);font-size:12px;font-weight:700">claude-agent-acp</span>
        <span style="padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);font-size:12px;font-weight:700">codex-acp</span>
        <span style="padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);font-size:12px;font-weight:700">copilot</span>
        <span style="padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);font-size:12px;font-weight:700">gemini</span>
        <span style="margin-left:auto;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px">Any ACP agent via <span class="kbd">ACP_AGENT_COMMANDS</span></span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- STATS (live GitHub) -->
  <section id="stats" class="section" style="background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), transparent);border-block:1px solid var(--border)">
    <div class="container">
      <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;align-items:end;justify-content:space-between">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow reveal">Live stats</div>
          <h2 class="reveal" data-delay="60" style="margin-top:8px">Built in public. <span style="color:var(--accent-2)">Stats breathe.</span></h2>
          <p class="lead reveal" data-delay="100" style="margin-top:6px">Stars, forks, releases fetched live from GitHub. Numbers animate with CountUp.js + anime.js — like anime.js but for data.</p>
        </div>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost reveal" data-delay="120" href="https://github.com/Raza-learner/Runmote" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">View GitHub →</a>
      </div>

      <div class="grid reveal" data-delay="160" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);margin-top:22px">
        <div class="card stat">
          <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px">
            <svg width="44" height="44" viewBox="0 0 44 44"><circle cx="22" cy="22" r="16" fill="none" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.08)" stroke-width="3"/><path class="stat-ring" d="M 22 6 A 16 16 0 1 1 21.99 6" fill="none" stroke="#FFB84D" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
            <div><div id="stat-stars" class="stat-num" data-value="0">0</div><div class="stat-label">GitHub stars</div></div>
          </div>
          <div style="color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;margin-top:8px">Live from <code>api.github.com</code></div>
        </div>
        <div class="card stat">
          <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px">
            <svg width="44" height="44" viewBox="0 0 44 44"><circle cx="22" cy="22" r="16" fill="none" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.08)" stroke-width="3"/><path class="stat-ring" d="M 22 6 A 16 16 0 1 1 21.99 6" fill="none" stroke="#7C5CFF" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
            <div><div id="stat-forks" class="stat-num" data-value="0">0</div><div class="stat-label">Forks</div></div>
          </div>
          <div style="color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;margin-top:8px">Community copies</div>
        </div>
        <div class="card stat">
          <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px">
            <svg width="44" height="44" viewBox="0 0 44 44"><circle cx="22" cy="22" r="16" fill="none" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.08)" stroke-width="3"/><path class="stat-ring" d="M 22 6 A 16 16 0 1 1 21.99 6" fill="none" stroke="#2EF2A0" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
            <div><div id="stat-releases" class="stat-num" data-value="0">0</div><div class="stat-label">Releases</div></div>
          </div>
          <div style="color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;margin-top:8px">Ship cadence</div>
        </div>
        <div class="card stat"><div id="stat-latency" class="stat-num" data-value="87">0</div><div class="stat-label">p95 relay latency</div><div style="color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;margin-top:8px">WSS/TLS • Render</div></div>
        <div class="card stat"><div id="stat-platforms" class="stat-num" data-value="6">0</div><div class="stat-label">Platforms</div><div style="color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;margin-top:8px">iOS Android Lin Mac Win Web</div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="card reveal" data-delay="200" style="margin-top:16px;padding:14px">
        <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:8px">
          <b style="font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)">Relay p95 (last hour) — Chart.js animates on scroll</b>
          <span style="font-size:11px;color:var(--faint)">anime.js + Chart.js</span>
        </div>
        <div style="height:120px"><canvas id="sparkline" height="120"></canvas></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ARCHITECTURE -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 0.9fr;gap:22px;align-items:center">
      <div class="reveal">
        <div class="eyebrow">Architecture</div>
        <h2 style="margin-top:8px">No hacks. Just WSS.</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px">Phone → Relay (FastAPI) → Daemon → ACP agent via stdin/stdout JSON-RPC 2.0. Session lives on your machine, not the relay. Self-host the relay — one Docker container.</p>
        <div class="code-pill" style="margin-top:12px">docker compose up -d <span style="color:var(--faint)">→ set ACP_RELAY_URL to your server</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="card reveal" data-delay="120" style="overflow:hidden;padding:0">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 640 260" width="100%" height="auto" style="display:block;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#0B1020,#070A14)">
          <defs><linearGradient id="g" x1="0" x2="1"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="#7C5CFF"/><stop offset="100%" stop-color="#2EF2A0"/></linearGradient></defs>
          <rect x="24" y="48" width="150" height="92" rx="16" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.06)" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.08)"/><text x="99" y="86" text-anchor="middle" fill="#EAF0FF" font-size="12" font-weight="800">Flutter App</text><text x="99" y="104" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8E9BB5" font-size="10">iOS / Android</text>
          <rect x="245" y="48" width="150" height="92" rx="16" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.06)" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.08)"/><text x="320" y="86" text-anchor="middle" fill="#EAF0FF" font-size="12" font-weight="800">Relay</text><text x="320" y="104" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8E9BB5" font-size="10">FastAPI • WSS</text>
          <rect x="466" y="48" width="150" height="92" rx="16" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.06)" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.08)"/><text x="541" y="86" text-anchor="middle" fill="#EAF0FF" font-size="12" font-weight="800">Daemon</text><text x="541" y="104" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8E9BB5" font-size="10">Python • your PC</text>
          <line x1="174" y1="94" x2="245" y2="94" stroke="url(#g)" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="6 6"/><line x1="395" y1="94" x2="466" y2="94" stroke="url(#g)" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="6 6"/>
          <rect x="466" y="168" width="150" height="64" rx="16" fill="rgba(124,92,255,0.12)" stroke="rgba(124,92,255,0.25)"/><text x="541" y="196" text-anchor="middle" fill="#EAF0FF" font-size="11" font-weight="800">ACP Agent</text><text x="541" y="212" text-anchor="middle" fill="#B9A6FF" font-size="9">opencode / claude / codex</text>
          <line x1="541" y1="140" x2="541" y2="168" stroke="#7C5CFF" stroke-width="2"/>
          <text x="208" y="88" fill="#8E9BB5" font-size="9">WSS</text><text x="428" y="88" fill="#8E9BB5" font-size="9">WSS</text><text x="548" y="156" fill="#8E9BB5" font-size="9">stdio JSON-RPC</text>
        </svg>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <section id="faq" class="section" style="padding-top:0">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="reveal">FAQ</h2>
      <div style="margin-top:16px">
        <details class="faq reveal"><summary>Does my PC need to stay on? <span style="color:var(--muted)">+</span></summary><p>Yes — daemon runs as background process, idle when not used. Use <span class="kbd">runmote start</span> / <span class="kbd">runmote status</span>.</p></details>
        <details class="faq reveal" data-delay="60"><summary>Is this secure? <span style="color:var(--muted)">+</span></summary><p>All WSS/TLS. Session data lives on your machine, not the relay. Self-host via Docker if you want full control.</p></details>
        <details class="faq reveal" data-delay="120"><summary>How does pairing work — can anyone connect? <span style="color:var(--muted)">+</span></summary><p>Fresh 8-digit + QR each daemon start. Only someone seeing your terminal/log can connect. Rotates on restart.</p></details>
        <details class="faq reveal" data-delay="140"><summary>Does this work on iPhone AND Android? <span style="color:var(--muted)">+</span></summary><p>Yes — Flutter native builds. Play Store + APK in Releases. iOS via TestFlight/sideload until App Store review.</p></details>
        <details class="faq reveal" data-delay="160"><summary>Can I run my own relay? <span style="color:var(--muted)">+</span></summary><p>Absolutely — <span class="kbd">docker compose up -d</span> then set <span class="kbd">ACP_RELAY_URL</span> in daemon env.</p></details>
      </div>

      <div class="card reveal" data-delay="180" style="margin-top:18px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between">
        <div><h3 style="margin:0">Ready to code from anywhere?</h3><p style="margin:4px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px">One command. 30 seconds. No VPN.</p></div>
